    "description": "<p>So Speaks the Ebon Dragon permanently alters the costs and mechanics of the Infernal's Ebon Dragon Excellency suite. The First Ebon Dragon Excellency now provides two dice per mote spent rather than one, and the Second Ebon Dragon Excellency now provides one automatic success per mote spent rather than one per two motes. Ebon Dragon Inevitability Technique no longer requires a Willpower expenditure, costing four motes instead. So Speaks the Ebon Dragon is incompatible with Effortless Ebon Dragon Dominance.</p>",
